---
// Footer.astro - Pie de página institucional y credenciales corporativas
---

<footer class="relative bg-[#06090F] border-t border-white/10 pt-16 pb-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-white/10">
      
      <!-- Column 1: Brand & Manifesto -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M2 10v3" />
              <path d="M6 6v11" />
              <path d="M10 3v18" />
              <path d="M14 8v7" />
              <path d="M18 5v13" />
              <path d="M22 10v4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-xl text-white leading-none">
            SÓNICA<span class="text-brand-cyan">.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">PERÚ</span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="font-body text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md mb-6">
          Agencia boutique de diseño, producción integral de eventos corporativos, activaciones BTL, branding y marketing experiencial. Donde las ideas no se presentan: se viven.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <!-- WhatsApp Link -->
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/51948435104"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="WhatsApp"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Instagram -->
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Instagram"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-cyan hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-all"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/>
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/>
              <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Facebook -->
          <a
            href="https://facebook.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Facebook"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-surface border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-blue hover:border-brand-blue/40 transition-all"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Direct Contact -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white font-semibold mb-4">
          Contacto Directo
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-body">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-cyan shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Calle Manuel Portocarrero 344-A, Surquillo, Lima - Perú</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-cyan shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
            </svg>
            <a href="tel:+51948435104" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">+51 948 435 104</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-cyan shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
            </svg>
            <a href="mailto:leo.dela.c@gmail.com" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">leo.dela.c@gmail.com</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Quick Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white font-semibold mb-4">
          Navegación
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-body">
          <li><a href="#experiencias" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Experiencias</a></li>
          <li><a href="#servicios" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Servicios 360°</a></li>
          <li><a href="#casos" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Casos en Video</a></li>
          <li><a href="#cultura" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Nuestra Actitud</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contacto" class="hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors">Solicitar Cotización</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright & Legal -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} SÓNICA PERÚ. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="hover:text-slate-400 cursor-pointer">Surquillo, Lima</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span class="hover:text-slate-400 cursor-pointer">Producción 100% In-House</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
